title: Benefits and Insurance
subtitle: Labour: benefits for the unemployed and the insurance of workers.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_social_welfare.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'social_welfare') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.social_welfare (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.2). Opening and closing the card are free; a
// confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card. Z — 0.94 (decisions of
// 24 X 2026): benefits, the old-age insurance of workers and the cut of benefits; the focused variant left the card.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'social_welfare');
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_social_welfare');
!}

= Benefits and insurance

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The state can help the unemployed from the budget and insure the workers from contributions. [? if pl_gc_protection_level = 0 : There are no benefits for the unemployed yet. ?][? if pl_gc_protection_level > 0 : The benefits for the unemployed work at level [+ pl_gc_protection_level +] of 3. ?]

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @expand
- @insurance
- @limit
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@expand
title: [? if pl_gc_protection_level = 0 : Introduce benefits for the unemployed ?][? if pl_gc_protection_level > 0 : Extend the benefits ?]
subtitle: Costs 2 budget units a month for each of three levels. The unemployed get real help and are less discontented (−6).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'social_welfare', 'expand').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_social_welfare_expand_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'social_welfare', 'expand');
!}
go-to: result

@insurance
title: Introduce the old-age insurance of workers
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month and needs a law; employers and workers pay the rest in contributions. The workers are less discontented (−2), but business presses harder (+6).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'social_welfare', 'insurance').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_social_welfare_insurance_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'social_welfare', 'insurance');
!}
go-to: result

@limit
title: Limit the benefits
subtitle: A change of the law saves the budget 1 unit a month. The unemployed get less, and the dissent of the Left of PPS rises (+8).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'social_welfare', 'limit').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_social_welfare_limit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'social_welfare', 'limit');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Benefits and insurance

